=== scan_all
FROM orders
--- logical
Scan shop.orders
--- physical
CollectionScan shop.orders
=== scan_qualified
FROM shop.orders
--- logical
Scan shop.orders
--- physical
CollectionScan shop.orders
=== filter_unindexed
