=== between_on_index
FROM orders WHERE status BETWEEN 'a' AND 'm'
--- logical
Filter ((status >= 'a') AND (status <= 'm'))
  Scan shop.orders
--- physical
IndexScan shop.orders.by_status [('a') .. ('m')] fetch
