=== lambda_and_quantifier
FROM orders WHERE ANY x IN items SATISFIES x.qty > 1 SELECT filter(items, i -> i.qty > 0) AS f
--- logical
Project filter(items, (i) -> (i.qty > 0)) AS f
  Filter (ANY x IN items SATISFIES (x.qty > 1))
    Scan shop.orders
--- physical
